      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing a NoSQL Database**\n\nI'm leaning towards using a NoSQL database for the document querying functionality. I need to pick a specific provider soon and integrate its code into `query_documents.py`. This choice is fundamental to the architecture.\n\n\n**Selecting Firestore Integration**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Firestore. I'm now integrating its client initialization and imports into `query_documents.py`. The file will showcase queries for documents by field values, and simulate partition-key queries by specific collection path filtering. I'll include detailed comments for clarity.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789867055387,
          "start": 1789867053528
        },
